      "writtenOn": "2019-12-02T08:19:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If it is true, it means provisionSubscriber(cTag, sTag, tpId) method works as before (installs transparent flows). If you use provisionSubscriber(connectPoint) method, then it installs regular flows. I didn\u0027t break the previous behavior actually.\n\nFor DT use case, we can use enableTransparentFlows as true; provisionSubscriber(connectPoint) installs regular flows using push-pop actions - provisionSubscriber(cTag, sTag, tpId) installs transparent flows as before.\n\nFor the TT use case, we can use enableTransparentFlows as false; provisionSubscriber(connectPoint) installs all services that are found in SADIS. provisionSubscriber (cTag, sTag, tpId) installs services one by one.\n\nIf the DT use-case has another workflow, please let me know.",
